5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to be precise about the costs this year. I'll look into the group transport receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I want to avoid overloading the organizers. I'll check the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, as well as the lottery and application for public group bookings.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"To ensure the members actually bond, I'll look into what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the attendance sheets for the away camps.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'm concerned about the quality of rest. I will look into the accounts from two clubs that went inland and the vacation timetable for the club's own hall.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds and the membership list against first-train times.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Does anyone else feel we are missing something regarding the actual facilities? I'm satisfied with my choices, but I want to ensure we aren't overlooking the logistics of the sites themselves.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, I believe the lottery and application details I'm checking will cover the logistics of public sites. If we find those too restrictive, we can adjust our thinking.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Toshio. Between the logistics and the social dynamics I'm researching, we should have a clear picture of whether a public facility or a private one serves us better.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe the accounts from other clubs will provide a realistic view of the facilities. I am content with my selections for now.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I believe the rate sheets and train times will clarify the financial and physical accessibility of the options. I have no further additions to the list.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
