59,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I've weighed the risks, and the Coastal Lodge is the most reasonable choice for our budget and stability. I vote for the Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The Coastal Lodge removes the administrative burden and the cooking duty, which is essential for the organizers' well-being. I vote for the Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Minako,,"To ensure the members actually bond and stay together in one place, the Coastal Lodge is the best fit. I vote for the Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Considering the poor sleep quality at inland centers and the scheduling issues on campus, the Coastal Lodge is the only viable option. I vote for the Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"I have already cast my vote, but for the record, the Coastal Lodge is the most logical choice. I vote for the Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
